o-- where it was in 2008. https://t.co/1afEH17DMn","url":"https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2109395437824491527"},{"author_id":"626660983","created_at":"2026-10-11T18:33:07.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109351606810464387"],"id":"2109351606810464387","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":1791,"like_count":10,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2109165914541191168","type":"quoted"}],"text":"Samoa will end up a Pentecostal-LDS country! https://t.co/SFdDpBWc5Y","url":"https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2109351606810464387"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2109054302287192064"]},"author_id":"11348282","created_at":"2026-10-11T16:30:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109320622882873464"],"id":"2109320622882873464","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1595,"impression_count":2005251,"like_count":19302,"quote_count":668,"reply_count":704,"retweet_count":3513},"text":"While observing the universe, @NASAHubble caught a galaxy cluster smiling for the camera. 😊\n\nThe smile lines are arcs caused by an effect known as gravitational lensing, where massive structures warp spacetime with their powerful gravitational forces and act as a cosmic lens. https://t.co/R3YMVpOqt4","url":"https://x.com/NASA/status/2109320622882873464"},{"author_id":"626660983","created_at":"2026-10-11T04:00:34.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109132021805273301"],"id":"2109132021805273301","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":92,"impression_count":12503,"like_count":642,"quote_count":5,"reply_count":11,"retweet_count":76},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2108999600933617868","type":"quoted"}],"text":"Interesting math suggesting immigration actually worsened Spain's fiscal balance long-run. https://t.co/qmkLZ0SmuI","url":"https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2109132021805273301"},{"author_id":"19355829","created_at":"2026-10-10T21:38:32.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109035880832802941"],"id":"2109035880832802941","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":